WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.044
Watch and read: While at the market, Ama thinks about this: A story ends when Ama

00:00:05.044 --> 00:00:08.072
finds her lost book. What is a sensible next event?

00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:13.975
The answer is: Ama returns to class and shows her teacher. Extensions should follow

00:00:13.975 --> 00:00:15.051
the plot logically.

00:00:15.867 --> 00:00:20.459
Watch and read: Kojo is learning with a partner at school. Before adding an event to

00:00:20.459 --> 00:00:22.181
a story, what should you ask?

00:00:23.033 --> 00:00:27.566
The answer is: What might happen next because of the ending?. New events follow

00:00:27.566 --> 00:00:28.537
earlier story events.
